    /// (animations/.../name.caf, in any case), as the game's own animation rows that play it say. Null
    /// for a clip no row plays, such as a .caf your resource ships. Pair it with playAnimation's clip
    /// and playerAnimationEnd to time a scene. (Server only.)
    /// </summary>
    /// <param name="name">The clip's name, such as 'bartender_serve_tray_f_01', or its path.</param>
    /// <returns>number | null</returns>
